
TYPES: #eg-0307 televisionblock, broadcastservice, televisionepisode

PRE-MARKUP:

Example of a television programming block with a live broadcast, broadcast service, television episode, presenters, performers and production company.

MICRODATA:

HTML
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/BroadcastEvent">
  <h1 itemprop="name">Nome do Bloco de TV</h1>

  <meta itemprop="startDate" content="2026-10-08T20:00:00-04:00">
  <meta itemprop="endDate" content="2026-10-08T22:00:00-04:00">
  <meta itemprop="isLiveBroadcast" content="true">

  <div itemprop="publishedOn" itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/BroadcastService">
    <span itemprop="name">WAAY-TV</span>
    <span itemprop="broadcastDisplayName">ABC</span>

    <div itemprop="broadcastAffiliateOf" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization">
      <span itemprop="name">ABC</span>
    </div>

    <div itemprop="provider" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization">
      <span itemprop="name">Comcast</span>
    </div>

    <div itemprop="owner" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization">
      <span itemprop="name">Comcast</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="workPerformed" itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/TVEpisode">
    <h2 itemprop="name">Nome do Programa</h2>

    <div itemprop="presenter" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
      <span itemprop="name">Nome do Apresentador</span>
    </div>

    <div itemprop="performer" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
      <span itemprop="name">Participante 1</span>
    </div>

    <div itemprop="performer" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
      <span itemprop="name">Participante 2</span>
    </div>

    <div itemprop="partOfSeries" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/TVSeries">
      <span itemprop="name">Nome da Série</span>
    </div>

    <div itemprop="productionCompany" itemscope
         itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization">
      <span itemprop="name">Nome da Produtora</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


